1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,424
Credit teams still piece covenant analysis
together from documents,

2
00:00:04,424 --> 00:00:06,405
spreadsheets, and screenshots.

3
00:00:06,405 --> 00:00:10,235
The numbers may be right, but the trail is
hard to verify.

4
00:00:10,235 --> 00:00:15,320
Assay makes every figure evidence-linked
and every payment bounded by policy.

5
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:19,989
This is the covenant operations workspace:
borrowers, facilities,

6
00:00:19,989 --> 00:00:23,437
runs, approvals, and audit evidence in one
view.

7
00:00:23,437 --> 00:00:26,095
The workspace is synthetic by design,

8
00:00:26,095 --> 00:00:30,118
with no public signup and no autonomous
credit decision.

9
00:00:30,118 --> 00:00:31,751
Inside a completed run,

10
00:00:31,751 --> 00:00:35,371
Assay shows the confidential inference
attestation,

11
00:00:35,371 --> 00:00:39,133
the financial snapshot, and the covenant
calculation.

12
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:43,605
Baseline leverage is 3.07 times against a
3.50 times threshold,

13
00:00:43,605 --> 00:00:45,592
with stress cases beside it.

14
00:00:45,592 --> 00:00:48,645
Deterministic code performs the
arithmetic.

15
00:00:48,645 --> 00:00:52,265
A zero-knowledge proof verifies the
private inputs,

16
00:00:52,265 --> 00:00:55,246
and a credit manager records the approval.

17
00:00:55,246 --> 00:00:57,815
Privacy is enforced before reasoning.

18
00:00:57,815 --> 00:01:00,383
Documents are redacted with Presidio,

19
00:01:00,383 --> 00:01:04,479
encrypted in private storage under a
borrower-specific key,

20
00:01:04,479 --> 00:01:05,451
and tokenized.

21
00:01:05,451 --> 00:01:09,617
Only structured, extracted data reaches
the reasoning model.

22
00:01:09,617 --> 00:01:12,463
Audit events are hash-chained and signed.

23
00:01:12,463 --> 00:01:17,400
For market context, Assay's planner
proposed a paid provider,

24
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:20,718
and the analyst selected LoneStar Oracle.

25
00:01:20,718 --> 00:01:26,221
LoneStar returned a real x402 requirement:
0.05 USDC on Arc Mainnet,

26
00:01:26,221 --> 00:01:28,244
standard exact, EIP-3009.

27
00:01:28,244 --> 00:01:33,747
Assay checked provider, endpoint,
recipient, network, asset, amount,

28
00:01:33,747 --> 00:01:37,551
budget, expiry, and idempotency before
signing.

29
00:01:37,551 --> 00:01:42,406
One payment was authorized, confirmed by a
provider receipt,

30
00:01:42,406 --> 00:01:47,343
and the Apple fundamentals were stored as
encrypted evidence.

31
00:01:47,343 --> 00:01:48,706
On Arc Mainnet,

32
00:01:48,706 --> 00:01:54,614
the explorer shows a successful
transferWithAuthorization of 0.05

33
00:01:54,614 --> 00:01:59,704
USDC from Assay's payer wallet to the
verified merchant.

34
00:01:59,704 --> 00:02:03,340
The wallet moved from 0.93 to 0.88 USDC.

35
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:08,584
The evidence record carries the source
URL, retrieval time,

36
00:02:08,584 --> 00:02:13,384
a SHA-256 hash of the raw response,
validation status,

37
00:02:13,384 --> 00:02:15,429
and the payment intent.

38
00:02:15,429 --> 00:02:19,340
Price, analyst target, market cap, P/E,
EPS,

39
00:02:19,340 --> 00:02:25,384
and the 52-week range are shown as
financial facts, not model prose.

40
00:02:25,384 --> 00:02:29,816
Assay separates policy approval, payment
settlement, calculation,

41
00:02:29,816 --> 00:02:31,589
proof, and human approval.

42
00:02:31,589 --> 00:02:36,226
A timeout becomes reconciliation required,
never an automatic retry.

43
00:02:36,226 --> 00:02:40,658
The audit chain verifies all thirty-two
events for this borrower,

44
00:02:40,658 --> 00:02:43,726
including the payment and evidence
retrieval.

45
00:02:43,726 --> 00:02:48,555
Assay: evidence-linked analysis, bounded
agentic payments,

46
00:02:48,555 --> 00:02:51,385
and an audit trail you can verify.

47
00:02:51,385 --> 00:02:53,134
The model interprets.

48
00:02:53,134 --> 00:02:54,466
Code calculates.

49
00:02:54,466 --> 00:02:56,131
Cryptography proves.

50
00:02:56,131 --> 00:02:57,546
A human approves.
